@startuml domain-model
' TurbineH — Internal Invoicing & Payment Tracking System (Submission 2, task #42)
' Domain model: only the core business concepts, their key attributes and
' associations, derived from the Functional Requirements and the 22 use cases.
' Supporting data (audit trail, backups, templates, imports, settings,
' notifications, comments, attachments...) is detailed in the ER diagram (#44)
' and the class diagram (#45). No types or operations here.

top to bottom direction
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #2B3E6A
    FontColor #000000
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FDE2B8
    BorderColor #2B3E6A
    FontColor #000000
}
skinparam arrow {
    Color #2B3E6A
}

class User {
    corporateEmail
    role
}

class Customer {
    legalName
    taxId
    country
    status
}

class Contact {
    name
    email
    whatsAppConsent
}

class Subscription {
    startDate
    status
    agreedRate
}

class RateTier {
    minAnnualRevenue
    maxAnnualRevenue
    monthlyPrice
}

class AnnualReview {
    year
    annualRevenue
    status
}

class Cancellation {
    requestDate
    effectiveDate
}

class Invoice {
    type
    number
    status
    dueDate
    total
}

class InvoiceLine {
    description
    quantity
    unitPrice
}

class Concept {
    name
    defaultPrice
}

class Payment {
    amount
    date
    reference
}

class Reminder {
    type
    sentAt
}

class ApprovalRequest {
    type
    status
}

class BillingIssue {
    type
    status
}

' --- customers and subscriptions
User "1" -- "0..*" Customer : is responsible for
Customer "1..*" -- "0..*" Contact : has
Customer "1" -- "0..*" Subscription : contracts
Subscription "0..*" -- "1..*" Concept : bills
Subscription "1" -- "0..*" AnnualReview : reviewed in
AnnualReview "0..*" -- "1" RateTier : proposes
Subscription "1" -- "0..1" Cancellation : ended by

' --- invoicing and collection
Customer "1" -- "0..*" Invoice : is billed with
Subscription "0..1" -- "0..*" Invoice : generates
Invoice "1" *-- "1..*" InvoiceLine : contains
InvoiceLine "0..*" -- "0..1" Concept : based on
Invoice "0..1" -- "0..*" Invoice : corrected by
Invoice "1..*" -- "0..*" Payment : settled by
Invoice "1" -- "0..*" Reminder : followed up by
Invoice "0..1" -- "0..*" BillingIssue : about

' --- governance
User "1" -- "0..*" ApprovalRequest : requests / decides
ApprovalRequest "0..*" -- "0..1" Invoice : about

note right of Cancellation
  **FR4.1**: no new invoices from the
  effective date; previous invoices
  stay in collection (C4).
end note

note right of Payment
  **FR3.1**: an invoice is paid only
  through the payments reconciled
  with it.
end note

note bottom of Reminder
  Sent automatically by the system
  scheduler, not by an actor (#27).
end note

@enduml
